sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as rhods-operator<br/>(Orchestrator)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as Workbenches Operator<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant ConfigMap as odh-workbenches-config<br/>ConfigMap
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS (service-CA)
    participant SAR as SubjectAccessReview<br/>API
    participant HP as HardwareProfile CR

    Note over Orchestrator, Operator: Flow 1: Workbenches CR Reconciliation

    Orchestrator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Workbenches CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event (Workbenches CR)<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Read odh-workbenches-config<br/>ConfigMap (version handshake)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: ConfigMap data<br/>(distribution.name, version, platformVersion)
    Operator->>Operator: Render kustomize manifests<br/>(kf-notebook-controller,<br/>odh-notebook-controller,<br/>ImageStreams)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply (ForceOwnership)<br/>Deployments, RBAC, CRDs, Webhooks
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update Workbenches CR status<br/>(phase, conditions, releases)

    Note over K8sAPI, Webhook: Flow 2: Notebook Connection Secret Injection

    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission request (Notebook CREATE/UPDATE)<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS (service-CA)
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: GET Secret (verify existence)<br/>HTTPS/443, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Webhook: Secret data
    Webhook->>SAR: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(verify user can GET secrets)<br/>HTTPS/443, ServiceAccount token
    SAR-->>Webhook: Allowed/Denied
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response<br/>(JSON patch: inject envFrom secretRef)

    Note over K8sAPI, Webhook: Flow 3: HardwareProfile Injection

    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission request (Notebook CREATE/UPDATE)<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS (service-CA)
    Webhook->>HP: GET HardwareProfile<br/>(infrastructure.opendatahub.io/v1)<br/>HTTPS/443, ServiceAccount token
    HP-->>Webhook: HardwareProfile spec<br/>(resources, nodeSelectors, tolerations)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response<br/>(JSON patch: inject resources,<br/>nodeSelector, tolerations)
